#
# Rendered by `make demo`, which puts the release build on PATH.
Output .github/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1100
Set Height 520
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "tunnelward --version" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "tunnelward --help" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 4s
